{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Seed Chat Completions — クイックスタート",
    "description": "Chat Completions を使い、5 分で Seed に最初のチャットリクエストを送ります。",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://direct.evolink.ai",
      "description": "本番環境（推奨）"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "代替 URL"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/chat/completions": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Chat Completions で Seed との会話を開始",
        "description": "- OpenAI SDK で Seed を呼び出します。\n- 同期リクエストでは応答が直接返ります。\n- 最小限のパラメーターで始められます。\n- 対応モデル — `doubao-seed-2-1-pro`, `doubao-seed-2-1-turbo`, `doubao-seed-2-1-lite`, `doubao-seed-evolving`, `doubao-seed-2.0-pro`, `doubao-seed-2.0-lite`, `doubao-seed-2.0-mini`, `doubao-seed-2.0-code`\n- **Seed 2.0 の旧モデル名**：`doubao-seed-2.0-pro` / `doubao-seed-2.0-lite` は現在 `doubao-seed-2-1-lite`、`doubao-seed-2.0-code` は `doubao-seed-evolving` に転送されます。パラメータの動作は新しいモデルに準じます。新規連携では新しいモデル名を使用してください。`doubao-seed-2.0-mini` は変わりません\n- [API リファレンス](/ja/api-manual/language-series/doubao-seed-2.0/doubao-seed-2.0-reference)",
        "operationId": "createChatCompletionQuickSeed",
        "tags": [
          "チャット生成"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatCompletionQuickRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "チャット生成成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatCompletionResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "リクエストパラメータエラー",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 400,
                    "message": "Invalid request parameters",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未認証、トークンが無効または期限切れ",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 401,
                    "message": "Invalid or expired token",
                    "type": "authentication_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "クォータ不足、チャージが必要",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 402,
                    "message": "Insufficient quota",
                    "type": "insufficient_quota_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "https://evolink.ai/dashboard/credits"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "アクセス権限なし",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 403,
                    "message": "Access denied for this model",
                    "type": "permission_error",
                    "param": "model"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "リソースが存在しません",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 404,
                    "message": "Specified model not found",
                    "type": "not_found_error",
                    "param": "model",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "リクエスト頻度制限超過",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 429,
                    "message": "Rate limit exceeded",
                    "type": "rate_limit_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "retry after 60 seconds"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "サーバー内部エラー",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 500,
                    "message": "Internal server error",
                    "type": "internal_server_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "try again later"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "モデルサービスで一時的なエラーが発生しました。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 502,
                    "message": "Upstream AI service unavailable",
                    "type": "upstream_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "try different model"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "サービスが一時的に利用不可",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": 503,
                    "message": "Service temporarily unavailable",
                    "type": "service_unavailable_error",
                    "fallback_suggestion": "retry after 30 seconds"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "ChatCompletionQuickRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "messages"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "モデルの選択\n\n| モデル ID | 用途 | コンテキスト長 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `doubao-seed-2-1-pro` | 複雑な推論、長文書、コードベースに適した推奨の最上位モデル | 100 万トークン |\n| `doubao-seed-2-1-turbo` | 対話、データ抽出、エージェント処理向けの低価格モデル | 25.6 万トークン |\n| `doubao-seed-2-1-lite` | Seed 2.1 で最も低価格。音声入力に対応 | 100 万トークン |\n| `doubao-seed-evolving` | 新機能の評価向けに毎週更新 | 100 万トークン |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-pro` | 旧モデル名。現在は `doubao-seed-2-1-lite` に転送されます | 100 万トークン |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-lite` | 旧モデル名。現在は `doubao-seed-2-1-lite` に転送されます | 100 万トークン |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-mini` | 簡単なタスク向けの Seed 2.0 最速モデル | 25.6 万トークン |\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-code` | 旧モデル名。現在は `doubao-seed-evolving` に転送されます | 100 万トークン |\n\nSeed 2.1 のモデル ID はハイフン（`2-1`）、Seed 2.0 はピリオド（`2.0`）を使います。",
            "enum": [
              "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
              "doubao-seed-2-1-turbo",
              "doubao-seed-2-1-lite",
              "doubao-seed-evolving",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-pro",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-lite",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-mini",
              "doubao-seed-2.0-code"
            ],
            "default": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro",
            "example": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro"
          },
          "messages": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "チャットメッセージリスト",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MessageSimple"
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "example": [
              {
                "role": "user",
                "content": "こんにちは。自己紹介を 3 文でお願いします。"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "MessageSimple": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "role",
          "content"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "メッセージのロール",
            "enum": [
              "user"
            ]
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "メッセージ内容（プレーンテキスト）"
          }
        }
      },
      "ChatCompletionResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "チャット完了の一意識別子",
            "example": "0217714854126607f5a9cf8ed5b018c76e4ad3dc2810db57ffb50"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "このリクエストで使用したモデル。",
            "example": "doubao-seed-2-1-pro"
          },
          "object": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "chat.completion"
            ],
            "description": "レスポンスタイプ",
            "example": "chat.completion"
          },
          "created": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "作成タイムスタンプ",
            "example": 1771485416
          },
          "choices": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "チャット生成の選択肢リスト",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Choice"
            }
          },
          "usage": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Usage"
          }
        }
      },
      "Choice": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "index": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "選択肢のインデックス",
            "example": 0
          },
          "message": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AssistantMessage"
          },
          "finish_reason": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "完了理由",
            "enum": [
              "stop",
              "length",
              "content_filter"
            ],
            "example": "stop"
          },
          "moderation_hit_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "モデル出力テキストにセンシティブな情報が含まれる場合、ヒットしたリスク分類ラベルを返します\n\n- `severe_violation`: モデル出力テキストが重大な違反に該当\n- `violence`: モデル出力テキストが過激な行為に該当",
            "enum": [
              "severe_violation",
              "violence"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "AssistantMessage": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "メッセージ送信者の役割",
            "enum": [
              "assistant"
            ],
            "example": "assistant"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "AIが返信したメッセージ内容",
            "example": "こんにちは。推論、文章作成、プログラミング、マルチモーダル理解が得意な Seed 言語モデルです…"
          }
        }
      },
      "Usage": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "トークン使用統計情報",
        "properties": {
          "prompt_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "入力コンテンツのトークン数",
            "example": 15
          },
          "completion_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "思考を含む出力トークン数。",
            "example": 256
          },
          "total_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "合計トークン数",
            "example": 271
          },
          "prompt_tokens_details": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "入力トークン詳細情報",
            "properties": {
              "cached_tokens": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "キャッシュヒットしたトークン数",
                "example": 0
              }
            }
          },
          "completion_tokens_details": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "出力トークン詳細情報",
            "properties": {
              "reasoning_tokens": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "推論/思考チェーンのトークン数",
                "example": 0
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "HTTPステータスエラーコード"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "エラーの説明"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "エラータイプ"
              },
              "param": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "関連パラメータ名"
              },
              "fallback_suggestion": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "エラー時の提案"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "##すべてのAPIにBearer Token認証が必要です##\n\n**APIキーの取得：**\n\n[APIキー管理ページ](https://evolink.ai/dashboard/keys)にアクセスしてAPIキーを取得してください\n\n**リクエストヘッダーに追加：**\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```"
      }
    }
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "チャット生成",
      "description": "AIチャット生成関連API"
    }
  ]
}
